# R8 rules. AGP combines every .keep file in src/main/keepRules and passes them to R8.
#
# Tree-shaking only. The debug APK carried 29 MB of dex - all of Compose and
# Material, unshrunk - of which the launcher uses a fraction; R8 keeps what is
# reachable and drops the rest. Names stay as written, so a stack trace from the
# head unit reads without a mapping file, and line numbers survive for the same
# reason. The reflection in this app targets the ROM's own classes, not ours, so
# nothing here needs keeping by hand.
-dontobfuscate
-keepattributes SourceFile,LineNumberTable
